egin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4z+6 \\\\ 2z+2 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"
